Basic Shortcuts

| Shortcut | Action         |
| ---------| -------------- |
| Ctrl + C | Copy           |
| Ctrl + X | Cut            |
| Ctrl + V | Paste          |
| Ctrl + Z | Undo           |
| Ctrl + Y | Redo           |
| Ctrl + S | Save           |
| Ctrl + P | Print          |
| Ctrl + F | Find           |
| Ctrl + H | Find & Replace |

Data Selection

| Shortcut           | Action                     |
| -------------------| -------------------------- |
| Ctrl + A           | Select data                |
| Ctrl + Space       | Select entire column       |
| Shift + Space      | Select entire row          |
| Ctrl + ↑ / ↓       | Jump to top/bottom of data |
| Ctrl + ← / →       | Jump left/right in data    |
| Ctrl + Shift + ↑/↓ | Select data up/down        |

Formatting

| Shortcut         | Action            |
| -----------------| ----------------- |
| Ctrl + B         | Bold              |
| Ctrl + I         | Italic            |
| Ctrl + U         | Underline         |
| Ctrl + 1         | Format Cells      |
| Ctrl + Shift + $ | Currency format   |
| Ctrl + Shift + % | Percentage format |
| Ctrl + Shift + # | Date format       |

Data & Excel

| Shortcut         | Action                                  |
| -----------------| --------------------------------------- |
| Ctrl + T         | Create Table                            |
| Ctrl + Shift + L | Apply/Remove Filter                     |
| Alt + =          | AutoSum                                 |
| F2               | Edit cell                               |
| F4               | Repeat action / Lock cell reference `$` |
| Ctrl + ;         | Insert current date                     |
| Ctrl + Shift + ; | Insert current time                     |
| Alt + Enter      | New line inside cell                    |




